{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1515,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a82cfefc1da1c584c95058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "剩下的事，我一个人能搞定。\r\n请您去座位上吧。\r\n……您都没怎么休息吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17568dc133b87eef83606289f8e11a2088cd89fd67f84faa6752aa366f75d3f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3bc18fc6d2d5cbe9dc62e23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想保持这种状态，\r\n如果有人来搭话，\r\n应对工作就全交给您了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e1204578de019affcdc81d6ca19cfe1f01877401716d5f875817f9a206fa92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df5eb95ef01c2518b9404ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耳机，带了。\r\n歌也存进去了……嗯。\r\n在休息室里也能集中精神了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e59a66e490d01165a26571e71583c2680ae348c969f022e7aaac03faae68be4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4349bf2e565b11d1ab55103b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜服开线的地方昨晚已经\r\n补好了，也没有快掉的装饰……\r\n看来缝纫套装是用不上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18d9d6755c3c38d4960e744bd6e423b417a2378066878c8770c00f1a7b1ce2c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4afd84faa23e5f3036b4ef8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态很充分。\r\n……再加上\r\n我的实力的话……就能达到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39377fdecddb16c7b7f5beed9c0ee88a80dd0e6fb4825e986272fe27d7ca2996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d20409ab222f212c70614a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……声援什么的，就免了。\r\n……我该听的话，全都在\r\n训练中听过了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1308c36cfb5e9cbd75bf1ea34d35e2ea976dd27679d59283672aef5e6a2f0b52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5535b1eaad3206dec2f903ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整没赶上。\r\n……那又怎样。\r\n唯有获胜。我，无论何时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60fc4305b2a42920b44324c1b94c4dd920e610dc413e09c735cdd83d4b48f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6999b2a1ca3aa4d5b5038110",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊啊，震得耳朵疼……\r\n这欢呼声，不能想想办法吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "392259635f47c7e311882091488d3e7d0c6936946d83adc02945d081c089ad05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e536958d27ff571f8df11b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼…………——\r\n……走吧。\r\n出战时间可不会等人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca5ce1ed4002d58288bdbf3cf48529d7d019f6ae5e7cf330ed59e11b754e836e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0adea9c75265fc87ee6b7261",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好冷……\r\n……唔，不振作……一点的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26e74baaf9f526f214040fe3b9524670ed06f746a80fd12c9e00903d60128653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b8fd99401c41aa81d68b71e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很强……已经变强了。\r\n毕竟，是这样吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28fb1389407d2f3913d18fe6413caca711b40836eb3112fc7fe7a16d9731c953",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4298dd903607b2b0670c41bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢，赢，赢……！\r\n赢赢赢……！\r\n……唔，我，一定能赢的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2da06b16cffaa40cce780045f8520fa32b108768c0efb0aca7f5e2ef65c12a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e4a779804f168bdf4add09a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70bcd17e195a71993816492f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e71c83007cb4102d68fd4f343d2c98d7d1fb25c41be4fdeb173ca7eda918d7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1073ba8488a7fb7b4affd02c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7a9f97adb5bed9d4c6aca666dffd0e37fda970ebcfc2c8c0060523a483e295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7757250d266c4f4f82d9ba0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21bed79927e5236d335292545e9ebd0f5f41ee49249a49856519a27ee9095c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb61d9b14c1f80146be8819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ea67438b42beba60fa787e249a61303034c569b4024749cf2d8f0cab75af1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23229b4de98f70b539b3962f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf5b60b53a3f1bbf49d00d40c89fe4f8a57b24c00739201f3ff1f6193b1e0729",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45422b7b2f7485133d942a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb8722a5fb24b2d580420da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真拿你没办法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c917649c9190b4e2d17ebadc1dbb3b64de54e83235018a44dc92cc3e8a67f641",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6cf7428447d4844bedbaf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢您的观看……",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d0ddf7b3dc24fe4884e53a06e0af7eab007cd10d9138b1f0bb37e3813718b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50e26966d31f0d92e3c865c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受您照顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c26dbd47850b3db4af939815161583cd3f5cd1c566fc5cad29ffbdb9e899aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1abb0f2a46baa5cf0026a05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干脆利落地解决掉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db6e13c595863f9e5b61f1152cb875b8dffa6665b98361022fa4d1fa373e7737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c29db7a7aad620a11209fdc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……快点结束吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "021787757c33b7bd391462d2273eff62752824bede31e96ec11ae13a32ee948c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05a9e436162217c3ad80b080",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请多关照……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e546beb607c78391a13a35fae42de155540fc89abd524192b761dd1d1f1747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c16cc8c140ae6e807e009b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受您照顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c26dbd47850b3db4af939815161583cd3f5cd1c566fc5cad29ffbdb9e899aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:168955c0caa503fe1c2882da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耳机，带了。\r\n歌也存进去了……嗯。\r\n在休息室里也能集中精神了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e59a66e490d01165a26571e71583c2680ae348c969f022e7aaac03faae68be4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0927dfd8b610c5aa3ee9c61d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会让任何人追上。我所积累\n的东西比任何人都要多……\n不容许有任何松懈……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f288cc33700456d24a9187eacafb2c9c5fb6436a17d3b264e57f7d117c652d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa54867cfbabc99f6166148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受您照顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c26dbd47850b3db4af939815161583cd3f5cd1c566fc5cad29ffbdb9e899aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:688286336393d17ace39838e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:541e39012387d1d5b75ded3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……为什么，在眼前错失了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2fa97b47d0294ffd794c2c461942b39adee603a771863342c718b3b39e5e2db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4872310e14a80b0e971d435f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第3名……真是，难看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9507bbab7703068aced17e7989df59a7bd675c0de184731b947b020e06345195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57cb52888e54ad56df72f44f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太不像话了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1127a1c722f9b799402b702c7f6492b7e778b76fd051cb057b17d45a0d6c61d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b8b8d8174dfec000f2b0e00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可原谅……这样的话，我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6259a7a0ee0a67539b242aa91a126cfacd18dd9ad7e439ced6bac194a9ab6b48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076ab192399a157d83a1fe96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能达到至高境界的只有一人——那就是我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9247b9a44c5bdb2ecd990ca3d79a94d342f4174cc617eed103a97168a48cf618",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf196f6b54f47522ccf59461",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利是理所当然的。要强大到，能让人产生这种想法的程度……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b87e7253a91e2844635af31da84df8c3d41b704f4dda66d677d8b5f48c472fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2eea6ca29e0ec0acd34972d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只要全部赢下就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f370e797cb395ab9d5de671689580fd2feb1726fff67e52a8207baab568a0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36556f6c2d625abea0b6ca93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，尽情颤抖吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "018a4cca605cfccfa6eac8c4a364aa8c92bb04dabe5b907fb70d32a04f9b0aa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e174cfc0003576793be8ac13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在风雪交加的道路上，不甘于沉溺温暖——\r\n我选择了，那冻结一切的强大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d55a34a893cab0dbe8dd16e340e2bdf5bd9bfef6c713c74b7d70e1f237684bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4f5ce5f2f4e5111e6b2ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不需要，什么声援……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e54c30fd0929730e05619f7e3d05d04033be6aa0ebc953013f8f2495afaebed4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1f3f087f60434bc4609b44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了谁，为了什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd30cd477706fd5de8a0a4010d0f016b3426ff9b31c611264871922c4ba1f99c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7e11a11cd123a8676b44f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请不要，太在意我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c047fd7a0550c32e94b9bee66692f8d774ae4a26bc65e1428c36dcf7e7d8c0d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a392f61e6d12fd5f45e256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你是想要重新考虑\r\n契约吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2fcdf24efe6326807f8acb87ded2aafdd68f28fb2d5ba4792e5f4f6489aec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80488e0a8e0fd6eaa6bdacc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皱纹，灰尘……没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6091fda23a909372ce793e7390b926380caa4697b13b33e3931a10f34b6c64d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cf64dce1c1f3c70b2960235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对设计没有不满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ddbf281a4e4c3deaa6c75c365d3b1314231cf436359d0c7221d8e83535363c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd36eb2bdc13170fc4e1c2f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要强大就好。我一个人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05f06e195f58fa0ad00b9685799d204c54b6bd8204f8a4c1adf9e280b32623d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5473728f9dd0537c0c663ac1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开学典礼的照片……设施里的人也真是，明明不用挂起来的",
      "source_fingerprint": "7904c6b002177e2d7646c38c0ba4fc2236e7b137f17766e49b58cac3f22b402f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af532417fcebfcbcf080a5d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live，真的有必要吗……不，没什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6bc1a33adfe43da1a991331f129b61d7e77ba3c2c8dd2ad8f0ba73f827457fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f19958a2b9f7f8527ed5dbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都要强……将这份觉悟，倾注在这件衣服上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "279d8c1d68e0e867afb2b275930715ccb88483835f9043a7b89106115fe4ad36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfd87597b51aac91551e16d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿什么都不会改变。我就是我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725df83cb2959c27bbaf1465debe4d7bc8d5df113f9f9176aa7956bcf201a86a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a191bf3d05cd00081b63ef82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……已经，可以换衣服了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ef1814584d2c1632add1dabfbcb07152b411408472340dd4b65b0b2e9c1cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67f10aaeaebc2707fcf33b7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流行什么的……我不知道，我只穿自己想穿的",
      "source_fingerprint": "78c4ec56079599a7ce6765eb5e32f51558e15eeee8ab8de6732146d4a3760edc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a6a28ea6f9e2ee653c09bb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑色很好……因为毫不动摇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "534a7d7b67ff5ac82096b7c9168b2cabcdd41c65c703598bc642626e8083d318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:296df1c1085f067a7659cb7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皱纹，灰尘……没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6091fda23a909372ce793e7390b926380caa4697b13b33e3931a10f34b6c64d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bf39438ab333cac9db027c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对设计没有不满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ddbf281a4e4c3deaa6c75c365d3b1314231cf436359d0c7221d8e83535363c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da6a3e00713b4ebbee663308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要强大就好。我一个人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05f06e195f58fa0ad00b9685799d204c54b6bd8204f8a4c1adf9e280b32623d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be90313a080e9ccaee244d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开学典礼的照片……设施里的人也真是，明明不用挂起来的",
      "source_fingerprint": "7904c6b002177e2d7646c38c0ba4fc2236e7b137f17766e49b58cac3f22b402f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6e61c7ddf34e99b5fc6811",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live，真的有必要吗……不，没什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6bc1a33adfe43da1a991331f129b61d7e77ba3c2c8dd2ad8f0ba73f827457fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0912a58955843161952830c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都要强……将这份觉悟，倾注在这件衣服上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "279d8c1d68e0e867afb2b275930715ccb88483835f9043a7b89106115fe4ad36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdd410f34c36c94d27eb693c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿什么都不会改变。我就是我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725df83cb2959c27bbaf1465debe4d7bc8d5df113f9f9176aa7956bcf201a86a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:072594a2244d87c5a74b853f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……已经，可以换衣服了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ef1814584d2c1632add1dabfbcb07152b411408472340dd4b65b0b2e9c1cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd2795600b45935072083bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84d9533d884f9fa2baab1376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑步，我都是在天亮前解决的。\n因为那个时候最安静……\n呼吸也最顺畅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34a973bc7f84be8b9d124a7a22308106caab3b688bc26783b64c4e0dd905134b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884e61f30625d94beb57e646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……咖啡，只剩下黑咖啡了\r\n……糟透了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f9d88fcafe9e649081eac08ade7da1344af6cad1b2b8244d8226f0b97a5714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6bc6dcaab13234d981ec386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔同学，又在学生餐厅的\r\n角落里吃饭了……明明那个位置，\r\n我也盯上的说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeab14b5ddc0179e326fd288d4f1a8150624f4ee05a79c878283690d96f8215c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0dc3849004b17f4124fc6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唉。一到小测验前\r\n慌慌张张的孩子就那么多。急急忙忙地互相\r\n抽查题目……那样真的有效率吗，真是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c2896e216e42a7e9e0151d02ce078f48f025afc1d72c4ea30a35be91a84af12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7468e5608c3a4f06494b7c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回宿舍后，得在红梦同学\n开始唠叨前给她才行……\n美容面膜。敷的时候能安静些",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4926ae40b4d784acf009e81191d821d1006f6d149d1a0f3d85d97bcbc17e886",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:638840bb5b7d3af601283388",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作到这个时候吗。\r\n……请适可而止吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ee183afe7c54729729f09ae9dc117fa987cfd42e9cb8e584a45c79437aa41e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53646cacf385f41ac1f36a23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花开了呢。\r\n气槽前辈种的花。\r\n……每一朵，都很漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e127d3bafb1a277c9a12b7dbdf8cfd80e91a717aca88411b37e660b86a7de9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0722d7ff36684f70b3d2c928",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "防晒霜这种东西，为什么总是\r\n这么快就用完了呢……\r\n皮肤，不是都变红了吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ba07f50a232ea3a5e59de742b16ad84261a62a1c2fe9801b6ac26215aea5af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54605c37f38a1804f3b74be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……大概，又会一转眼就\r\n变冷了吧。\r\n……平稳的秋天，不过是一瞬之间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bdf8a54a71fc4049f43cfb14485ff3a5ecf4622bd1b0290942252ca4ed0bb67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f794fc858023ba28db35d7fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "围巾，在学校里\r\n不摘掉还是不太行的……\r\n……脖子，凉飕飕的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c17980198ef02b09fe4c44c7a86ac4110664edce5bfd0e4c96d452f5ce90fa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f85aeea643d45b7c23a1be4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说今天是，情人节呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18f8968d31815f4d24a4261d009ced91b413f492c9c831aa5f157680371a2c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a7bd219b33bb2cf3075bb65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红梦同学，……什么爱啊拯救啊的\n真是多管闲事。……只要别在睡前\n为了我祈祷就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4818f069ff816ef36d41cddc855c4ab04e4ab2c369e74a0db7a1a66b4ce71ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e404a8d26fee8d9be027418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不小心答应了……和大鸣大放同学\n的并跑……为什么，她要那么直勾勾\n地盯着我看呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1e5bb3586c9feb03ce2729e5c4ecbac39e419af30eb2c513f289c420812b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29fe75cb1458a67ae7e6cb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽前辈……\r\n明明不是那种有空来\r\n管我的人……唉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa1d969d02c71e36cd361a85ad7fd27d302fcaefa2c2c4bf8ac892c1287cec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:633b99500126612b4a305a0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……爱如往昔同学，又一个人\r\n在擦黑板了。\r\n……明明拜托班里的同学就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc5baaf599050b5b01cc6bc39242b7c96bf61ee957661da33d538b7eab189ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31424a945476bf732b30b662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新宇宙同学，晚上又在屋顶上\r\n眺望星空什么的……\r\n那样只会，感到寂寞的吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b059be97bcbfa6a9c56837e8d9f0ddba7c01ff05454b714d0c632cba85f6673b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9809d66d0c023d8e81ccbb17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选手和粉丝之间的关系……\r\n不过是奔跑者和观赛者而已。\r\n我觉得仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca4e3b56bfb586cab04e5e5c41fd51195581f0305d099727885a38c72af3174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d68422a4679bb6f39720dc65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发声训练也好，舞蹈课也好\n我都是拿出了成绩的。……不管是\n什么事，懈怠都让人感到不快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ee29316ec8e1895597263b4c988c710e2d8226014207f79776ce10d7992d11e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
